; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">投资关注点：</strong></h3><ol class="ol" style="padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">技术壁垒</strong>：是否有核心技术</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">产业化能力</strong>：能否大规模生产</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">应用场景</strong>：市场需求是否明确</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">团队背景</strong>：技术+产业经验</li></ol><h2 class="h2" data-heading="true" style="display: table; padding: 0 0.2em; margin: 4em auto 2em; color: #fff; background: #0F4C81; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center;">🌟 <strong class="strong" style="font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit; color: inherit !important;">结语：硬科技为AI插上翅膀</strong></h2><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">AI的发展不再仅仅是算法和数据的竞赛，<strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">硬件正在成为新的战场</strong>。从芯片到机器人，从可穿戴设备到算力基础设施，硬科技正在为AI插上&quot;翅膀&quot;，让智能：</p><ol class="ol" style="padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">从云端走向终端</strong>：边缘计算让AI更贴近用户</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">从虚拟走向现实</strong>：机器人让AI有了&quot;身体&quot;</li><li class="listitem